{"id":"29089bebddadc656","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-promise-ma-fixed-polynomial-lower-bound.md","title":"PromiseMA 的任意固定多项式规模下界","display":"thm-promise-ma-fixed-polynomial-lower-bound — PromiseMA 的任意固定多项式规模下界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-promise-ma-fixed-polynomial-lower-bound","aliases":["28-thm-promise-ma-fixed-polynomial-lower-bound"],"display":"thm-promise-ma-fixed-polynomial-lower-bound — PromiseMA 的任意固定多项式规模下界","depends_on":["[[28-df-promise-ma]]","[[28-df-promise-circuit-size]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 23.8","source_printed_pages":"504–505","source_pdf_pages":"530–531","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-promise-ma-fixed-polynomial-lower-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-promise-ma-fixed-polynomial-lower-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-promise-ma-fixed-polynomial-lower-bound — PromiseMA 的任意固定多项式规模下界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3e8c2b19a60e5f8\" href=\"?note=a3e8c2b19a60e5f8\" title=\"28-df-promise-ma\">28-df-promise-ma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"08147f5acef354b7\" href=\"?note=08147f5acef354b7\" title=\"28-df-promise-circuit-size\">28-df-promise-circuit-size</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 23.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"504–505"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"530–531"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PromiseMA}\">\\(\\operatorname{PromiseMA}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PromiseSIZE}\">\\(\\operatorname{PromiseSIZE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a3e8c2b19a60e5f8\" href=\"?note=a3e8c2b19a60e5f8\" title=\"28-df-promise-ma\">28-df-promise-ma</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"08147f5acef354b7\" href=\"?note=08147f5acef354b7\" title=\"28-df-promise-circuit-size\">28-df-promise-circuit-size</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\quad\\operatorname{PromiseMA}\\nsubseteq\\operatorname{PromiseSIZE}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\quad\\operatorname{PromiseMA}\\nsubseteq\\operatorname{PromiseSIZE}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>量词是每个固定 c 均存在一个承诺问题反例，不能交换成存在同一个问题同时击败所有多项式规模。用 n+2 处理极短长度且比原书 n^c 更强的常数差由先应用更大固定指数的定理吸收；有限长度可通过改变承诺域处理。原书证明依赖特殊 PSPACE 完备自归约问题与对电路复杂度的承诺 padding；本次核对陈述和承诺限定，未完整核验该技术链。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 23.8；印刷页 504–505；PDF 页 530–531。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-promise-ma","status":"resolved","id":"a3e8c2b19a60e5f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-promise-ma]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-promise-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"08147f5acef354b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-promise-circuit-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-promise-ma","status":"resolved","id":"a3e8c2b19a60e5f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PromiseMA}$、$\\operatorname{PromiseSIZE}$ 见 [[28-df-promise-ma]]、[[28-df-promise-circuit-size]]；$c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-promise-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"08147f5acef354b7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PromiseMA}$、$\\operatorname{PromiseSIZE}$ 见 [[28-df-promise-ma]]、[[28-df-promise-circuit-size]]；$c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{PromiseMA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PromiseSIZE}","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\quad\\operatorname{PromiseMA}\\nsubseteq\\operatorname{PromiseSIZE}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^c).","display":true}],"bytes":1690,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-417","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]、[[28-thm-formal-measure-formula-bound]]、[[28-lem-formal-measure-quarter-large]]、[[28-thm-formal-measure-almost-everywhere]]、[[28-df-promise-problem]]、[[28-df-promise-ma]]、[[28-df-promise-circuit-size]]、[[28-thm-promise-ma-fixed-polynomial-lower-bound]]、[[28-prop-xor-lower-bound-largeness]]、[[28-ex-singleton-property-not-large]]。"}],"outgoing":["a3e8c2b19a60e5f8","08147f5acef354b7"]}